{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026U2j3MjLBoq1795698890.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>泰國曼谷一間煉油廠爆炸引起大火，至少9人受傷。</p><p></p><p>煉油廠火勢猛烈，冒出大量濃煙。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.FIRE-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jqB7XYi7JD1795698915.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發於下午大約三時，當地傳媒報道，曼谷東區一間大型煉油廠有油庫發生爆炸，附近居民要疏散。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.FIRE-2300_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mbW4JDiAdt1795699255.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>大火在不到一小時後撲滅，居民可以回家，但當局提醒煉油廠方圓五公里內的居民，要特別注意空氣污染，有關部門派人評估周邊地區的空氣與水質。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.THAI.FIRE-2300_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HuP6eDmrBh1795699268.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>該煉油廠的標示產量為每日12萬桶，是泰國第五大煉油廠，也是泰國唯一位於都市的煉油廠，大火後已暫停運作。</p><p></p><p>能源部稱，泰國的石油供應應該不會受到影響，因為國內還有另外5座煉油廠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:23:55.285365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:20.890611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:17.429289+00:00","content_hash":"6b72ef9243b3066819391d49485ac6ae3fb33d0609e8eb006412101af0a5e893","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}